  "nameEn": "Endless Snake",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Walk the straight section to an obstacle, lighting lamps. Then turn right, and if there is an obstacle there too — turn the robot left. Repeat for all 6 sections.",
  "descriptionEn": "The snake bends right and left, and its straight sections have different lengths. A \"While\" loop walks a straight section, and after it you must pick the right turn.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Walk the straight section to an obstacle, turning off lamps. Then turn right, and if there is an obstacle there too — turn the robot left. Repeat for all 6 sections."
}
